const cLinked=(tx,c)=>[];const cLinkedOld=(tx,c)=>{if(!c||c.k==='coe'||c.unlink)return [];const d=cDead(tx,c);if(!d)return [];return (tx.cont||[]).filter(x=>x!==c&&x.k!=='coe'&&!x.waived&&!x.unlink&&cDead(tx,x)===d)};
const cdate=(tx,c)=>{const r=cdateRaw(tx,c);if(!r||!c||c.date||tx.f.roll==='no'||noRoll(c))return r;return iso(rollBiz(pd(r)))};
